1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:12,282
Speaking, task three. Story number 10: Christmas. What did the Petrenko family do on Christmas Eve? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:12,967 --> 00:00:15,300
What did the Petrenko family do on Christmas Eve?

3
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,953
On Christmas Eve the Petrenko family was at home all day.

4
00:00:39,167 --> 00:00:41,233
In the morning they decorated the Christmas tree.

5
00:00:41,433 --> 00:00:44,067
The children put baubles and lights on the tree.

6
00:00:44,267 --> 00:00:46,033
In the afternoon they baked Christmas cookies.

7
00:00:46,233 --> 00:00:49,563
Mum made the dough and the children cut out little stars.

8
00:00:49,767 --> 00:00:51,467
The whole flat smelled wonderful.

9
00:00:51,667 --> 00:00:54,351
In the evening they ate carp with potato salad.

10
00:00:54,567 --> 00:00:56,523
It was a traditional Czech dinner.

11
00:00:56,733 --> 00:00:59,425
Then they went to the tree and unwrapped the presents.

12
00:00:59,633 --> 00:01:01,767
The children got new toys and books.

13
00:01:01,967 --> 00:01:04,500
Everyone was very happy and in the evening they sang carols.

14
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:13,121
Tell story 10 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
